        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Flight: Return Home</strong> is a 3D shooter with survival elements, exploration, and a space atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a test flight of an experimental spaceship, the main character loses consciousness. Upon waking, he finds himself on an unknown planet. Gradually, he realizes that the planet is heading toward disaster — alien creatures are preparing to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will need to survive in this new world, explore the area, find resources, and defend against hostile creatures. Along the way, they uncover the truth and make decisions that could cost them their life — to save others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 3D shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements in an alien environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of an open planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visual and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story leading to self-sacrifice (but it all depends on your choice)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Flight: Return Home</strong> is a game about choice, struggle, and hope even in the darkest moments.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Flight: Return Home</strong> is a 3D shooter with survival elements, exploration, and a space atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a test flight of an experimental spaceship, the main character loses consciousness. Upon waking, he finds himself on an unknown planet. Gradually, he realizes that the planet is heading toward disaster — alien creatures are preparing to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will need to survive in this new world, explore the area, find resources, and defend against hostile creatures. Along the way, they uncover the truth and make decisions that could cost them their life — to save others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 3D shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements in an alien environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of an open planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visual and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story leading to self-sacrifice (but it all depends on your choice)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Flight: Return Home</strong> is a game about choice, struggle, and hope even in the darkest moments.</p>",
